    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061102.0125\n\nNANNING, Nov. 2 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nInt'l contracts with total investment of 5.845 bln USD inked at China-ASEAN Expo\n\n\n\n\nBusinessmen have signed 132 international cooperation projects involving investment of 5.845 billion US dollars by the press time at the ongoing Third China- ASEAN Expo, up 10.47 percent from the figures of last year's Expo.\n\nThe statistics was released by the Expo's Organizing Committee on Thursday.\n\nParticipants of the Third China-ASEAN Expo also endorsed 301 domestic cooperation projects involving 55.374 billion yuan (6.9 billion US dollars) of investment, up 10.36 percent from the figure of last year.\n\nThe Third China-ASEAN Expo was held here from Oct. 31 to Nov.3, attracting more than 2,000 companies from China and ASEAN countries.",
